<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FleetManager — Dispatch Pro</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
    <link rel="alternate icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any">

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        :root {
            --primary:   #2563eb;
            --primary-d: #1d4ed8;
            --dark:      #0f172a;
            --sub:       #475569;
            --muted:     #94a3b8;
            --border:    #e2e8f0;
            --bg:        #f8fafc;
            --white:     #ffffff;
            --radius:    12px;
        }

        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color: var(--dark); background: var(--white); line-height: 1.6; }

        a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }

        /* ── Nav ── */
        .nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 5%;
            height: 68px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .nav-logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .nav-logo-icon {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            background: var(--primary);
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .nav-logo-icon svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; fill: white; }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 32px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--sub);
        }

        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--dark); }

        .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 7px;
            padding: 9px 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all .15s;
            border: none;
        }

        .btn-ghost { background: none; color: var(--sub); }
        .btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--bg); color: var(--dark); }

        .btn-primary { background: var(--primary); color: white; }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-d); }

        .btn-primary-lg {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .btn-primary-lg:hover { background: var(--primary-d); }

        .btn-outline-lg {
            background: none;
            color: var(--dark);
            padding: 13px 32px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
        }
        .btn-outline-lg:hover { border-color: var(--primary); color: var(--primary); }

        /* ── Hero ── */
        .hero {
            padding: 96px 5% 80px;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 860px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: #eff6ff;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 5px 14px;
            border-radius: 100px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .hero-badge span { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--primary); }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(36px, 5.5vw, 64px);
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: -.02em;
            color: var(--dark);
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        .hero h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--primary); }

        .hero p {
            font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 19px);
            color: var(--sub);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 40px;
        }

        .hero-cta { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

        .hero-note { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }

        /* ── Stats ── */
        .stats {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--bg);
        }

        .stat {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 220px;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 36px 20px;
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .stat:last-child { border-right: none; }

        .stat-value { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--dark); }
        .stat-label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }

        /* ── Features ── */
        .section {
            padding: 88px 5%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: .1em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 40px);
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -.02em;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .section-sub {
            font-size: 17px;
            color: var(--sub);
            max-width: 560px;
            margin-bottom: 56px;
        }

        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: var(--bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 28px;
            transition: box-shadow .2s;
        }
        .feature-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #eff6ff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        .feature-icon svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; fill: var(--primary); }

        .feature-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .feature-desc  { font-size: 14px; color: var(--sub); line-height: 1.6; }

        /* ── How it works ── */
        .how-bg { background: var(--bg); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }

        .steps { display: flex; gap: 0; counter-reset: step; }

        .step {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 48px 36px;
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
            counter-increment: step;
            position: relative;
        }
        .step:last-child { border-right: none; }

        .step-num {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--border);
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .step-title { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .step-desc  { font-size: 14px; color: var(--sub); }

        /* ── Testimonial ── */
        .testimonial-section { text-align: center; padding: 88px 5%; }

        .testimonial-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .testimonial-card {
            background: var(--bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 28px;
        }

        .testimonial-text { font-size: 15px; color: var(--sub); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .testimonial-text::before { content: '\201C'; }
        .testimonial-text::after  { content: '\201D'; }

        .testimonial-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }

        .testimonial-avatar {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .testimonial-name  { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
        .testimonial-role  { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }

        /* ── CTA Banner ── */
        .cta-banner {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 5%;
        }

        .cta-banner h2 { font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .cta-banner p  { font-size: 17px; opacity: .85; margin-bottom: 36px; }

        .btn-white { background: white; color: var(--primary); padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; }
        .btn-white:hover { background: #f1f5f9; }

        /* ── Footer ── */
        footer {
            background: var(--dark);
            color: #94a3b8;
            padding: 48px 5%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .footer-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 700; color: white; font-size: 15px; }

        footer a { color: #94a3b8; }
        footer a:hover { color: white; }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .steps { flex-direction: column; }
            .step { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
            .step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
            .stats { flex-wrap: wrap; }
            .stat { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); min-width: 50%; }
        }

        /* ── Dark theme ── */
        [data-theme="dark"] {
            --dark:   #f1f5f9;
            --sub:    #94a3b8;
            --muted:  #475569;
            --border: #334155;
            --bg:     #1e293b;
            --white:  #0f172a;
        }

        [data-theme="dark"] body       { background: #0f172a; color: #cbd5e1; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .nav        { background: rgba(15,23,42,.95); border-bottom-color: #334155; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .nav-logo   { color: #f1f5f9; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .btn-ghost  { color: #94a3b8; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .btn-ghost:hover { background: #1e293b; color: #e2e8f0; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .hero-badge { background: rgba(37,99,235,.2); color: #60a5fa; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .hero h1    { color: #f1f5f9; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .hero p     { color: #94a3b8; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .hero-note  { color: #475569; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .btn-outline-lg { border-color: #334155; color: #e2e8f0; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .btn-outline-lg:hover { border-color: #3b82f6; color: #60a5fa; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .stats      { background: #111827; border-color: #1e293b; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .stat       { border-right-color: #1e293b; border-bottom-color: #1e293b; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .stat-value { color: #f1f5f9; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .stat-label { color: #475569; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .section-title { color: #f1f5f9; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .section-sub   { color: #94a3b8; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .feature-card  { background: #1e293b; border-color: #334155; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .feature-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
        [data-theme="dark"] .feature-icon  { background: rgba(37,99,235,.15); }
        [data-theme="dark"] .feature-title { color: #f1f5f9; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .feature-desc  { color: #94a3b8; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .how-bg  { background: #111827; border-color: #1e293b; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .step    { border-right-color: #1e293b; border-bottom-color: #1e293b; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .step-title { color: #f1f5f9; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .step-desc  { color: #94a3b8; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .step-num   { color: #1e293b; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .testimonial-card { background: #1e293b; border-color: #334155; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .testimonial-text { color: #94a3b8; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .testimonial-name { color: #f1f5f9; }
        [data-theme="dark"] .testimonial-role { color: #475569; }

        /* Theme toggle button */
        .landing-theme-btn {
            background: none;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 6px 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--sub);
            transition: all .15s;
        }
        .landing-theme-btn:hover { border-color: var(--primary); color: var(--primary); }
        .landing-theme-btn svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; display: block; }
    </style>
    <script>(function(){if(localStorage.getItem('fleet_theme')==='dark')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}());</script>
</head>
<body>

{# ── Nav ── #}
<nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-logo">
        <div class="nav-logo-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 8h-3V4H3c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v11h2c0 1.66 1.34 3 3 3s3-1.34 3-3h6c0 1.66 1.34 3 3 3s3-1.34 3-3h2v-5l-3-4zM6 18.5c-.83 0-1.5-.67-1.5-1.5s.67-1.5 1.5-1.5 1.5.67 1.5 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5 1.5zm13.5-9l1.96 2.5H17V9.5h2.5zm-1.5 9c-.83 0-1.5-.67-1.5-1.5s.67-1.5 1.5-1.5 1.5.67 1.5 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5 1.5z"/></svg>
        </div>
        FleetManager
    </div>

    <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#how">How it works</a>
        <a href="#testimonials">Testimonials</a>
    </div>

    <div class="nav-actions">
        <button id="landingThemeToggle" class="landing-theme-btn" title="Toggle dark mode">
            <svg class="icon-sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"/><line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"/><line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"/><line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"/><line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"/><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"/><line x1="4.22" y1="19.78" x2="5.64" y2="18.36"/><line x1="18.36" y1="5.64" x2="19.78" y2="4.22"/></svg>
            <svg class="icon-moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="display:none;"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/></svg>
        </button>
        <a href="{{ path('fleet_login') }}" class="btn btn-ghost">Sign In</a>
        <a href="{{ path('fleet_register') }}" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</a>
    </div>
</nav>

{# ── Hero ── #}
<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-badge"><span></span> Trusted by 500+ trucking companies</div>
    <h1>Run your fleet <em>smarter</em><br>and faster</h1>
    <p>Complete fleet management and dispatch platform. Track trucks in real-time, manage loads, drivers, and DOT compliance — all in one place.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="{{ path('fleet_register') }}" class="btn-primary-lg">Start Free Trial</a>
        <a href="#how" class="btn-outline-lg">See how it works</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-note">No credit card required &nbsp;·&nbsp; 14-day free trial &nbsp;·&nbsp; Cancel anytime</p>
</section>

{# ── Stats ── #}
<div class="stats">
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-value">10,000+</div><div class="stat-label">Trucks tracked daily</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-value">500+</div><div class="stat-label">Companies on board</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-value">99.9%</div><div class="stat-label">Platform uptime</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-value">24 / 7</div><div class="stat-label">Support available</div></div>
</div>

{# ── Features ── #}
<section class="section" id="features">
    <div class="section-label">Features</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Everything your fleet needs</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Built for dispatchers, fleet managers, and owner-operators who demand reliability.</p>

    <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zm0 9.5c-1.38 0-2.5-1.12-2.5-2.5s1.12-2.5 2.5-2.5 2.5 1.12 2.5 2.5-1.12 2.5-2.5 2.5z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-title">Real-Time GPS Tracking</div>
            <div class="feature-desc">Live location for every truck in your fleet. Know exactly where your assets are at all times with sub-minute updates.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 8h-3V4H3c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v11h2c0 1.66 1.34 3 3 3s3-1.34 3-3h6c0 1.66 1.34 3 3 3s3-1.34 3-3h2v-5l-3-4z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-title">Load & Dispatch Management</div>
            <div class="feature-desc">Create, assign, and track loads from pickup to delivery. A dispatch board that keeps your team in sync.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 12c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm0 2c-2.67 0-8 1.34-8 4v2h16v-2c0-2.66-5.33-4-8-4z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-title">Driver Management</div>
            <div class="feature-desc">Track driver performance, HOS compliance, payroll, and certifications in one unified profile.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm2 16H8v-2h8v2zm0-4H8v-2h8v2zm-3-5V3.5L18.5 9H13z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-title">DOT Compliance & Documents</div>
            <div class="feature-desc">Store and manage all compliance documents. Get alerts before anything expires — permits, registrations, insurances.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zM9 17H7v-7h2v7zm4 0h-2V7h2v10zm4 0h-2v-4h2v4z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-title">IFTA & Expense Reports</div>
            <div class="feature-desc">Automatic IFTA fuel tax reports and full expense tracking. Save hours every quarter at tax time.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-title">Maintenance & Inspections</div>
            <div class="feature-desc">Schedule preventive maintenance and log DVIRs. Never miss a service interval or fail a roadside inspection.</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{# ── How it works ── #}
<div class="how-bg" id="how">
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-label">How it works</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Up and running in minutes</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">No lengthy onboarding. Add your fleet and start dispatching on day one.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">01</div>
            <div class="step-title">Create your account</div>
            <div class="step-desc">Sign up, add your company details, and invite your team. Takes less than 5 minutes.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">02</div>
            <div class="step-title">Add your trucks & drivers</div>
            <div class="step-desc">Import your fleet from a spreadsheet or add vehicles and drivers one by one.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">03</div>
            <div class="step-title">Start dispatching</div>
            <div class="step-desc">Create loads, assign drivers, and watch your fleet move in real time on the live map.</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

{# ── Testimonials ── #}
<section class="testimonial-section" id="testimonials">
    <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom:12px;">Testimonials</div>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:48px;">What our customers say</h2>

    <div class="testimonial-grid">
        <div class="testimonial-card">
            <p class="testimonial-text">FleetManager cut our dispatch time in half. The live map alone is worth every penny — we always know where our trucks are.</p>
            <div class="testimonial-author">
                <div class="testimonial-avatar">MR</div>
                <div>
                    <div class="testimonial-name">Mike Rodriguez</div>
                    <div class="testimonial-role">Fleet Manager · Rodriguez Freight</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="testimonial-card">
            <p class="testimonial-text">Finally a platform built for trucking. IFTA reporting used to take us a whole day — now it's done in minutes.</p>
            <div class="testimonial-author">
                <div class="testimonial-avatar" style="background:#0d9488;">SL</div>
                <div>
                    <div class="testimonial-name">Sarah Lin</div>
                    <div class="testimonial-role">Owner-Operator · Lin Transport</div>
